  "title": "J-Long Group Limited Declared A Special Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "HONG KONG SAR – Media OutReach Newswire – 29 February 2024 – J-Long Group Limited (Nasdaq: JL) (the “Company” or “J-Long”), today announced that its board of directors has declared a special dividend of an aggregate of US$6,000,000.00 out of the distributable funds of the Company, to be paid to all holders of record as […]",
